      "seed": 511203714,
      "version": 176,
      "versionNonce": 1461409994,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769924373372,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## **Round 3: High-Level Design (Podcast Service)**\n\n**Topic:** Design a **Podcast Service** with:\n\n- Feed view\n- Subscribe/Unsubscribe to podcasts\n- Add podcasts and episodes\n\n**Note:**\n\nNo architecture diagram was expected. Focus was on:\n\n- API design (verbs, response codes, headers) - This is key, if you do any mistake they highlight it as if\nthe world has ended.\n- SQL queries\n- Data modeling",
      "fontSize": 27.60069578491766,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## **Round 3: High-Level Design (Podcast Service)**\n\n**Topic:** Design a **Podcast Service** with:\n\n- Feed view\n- Subscribe/Unsubscribe to podcasts\n- Add podcasts and episodes\n\n**Note:**\n\nNo architecture diagram was expected. Focus was on:\n\n- API design (verbs, response codes, headers) - This is key, if you do any mistake they highlight it as if the world has ended.\n- SQL queries\n- Data modeling",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
