      "updated": 1769924373372,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FR: \n- podcast name -> channel name ? on youtube. \n- add podcast -> add channel \n- add episode -> a single content like youtube videos. \n- feed -> as per subscription or recommendation type ? \n- user should be able to subscribe and unsubscribe. \n\n\nAssumption: \n- single podcast <-> single email address -> for simplicity \n    - create another account on this servcie -> another podcast. \n- no live streaming. \n- searching, ignore\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FR: \n- podcast name -> channel name ? on youtube. \n- add podcast -> add channel \n- add episode -> a single content like youtube videos. \n- feed -> as per subscription or recommendation type ? \n- user should be able to subscribe and unsubscribe. \n\n\nAssumption: \n- single podcast <-> single email address -> for simplicity \n    - create another account on this servcie -> another podcast. \n- no live streaming. \n- searching, ignore\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
