      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Api design:\n \n- POST \n- create podcast\n- /api/v1/podcast \n        x-token:  <>\n        https: general headers;\n\nRequest:   \n{\n    podcastName: <>\n    description: <> \n    .... \n    requestMeta: {} \n}\n\nResponse\n{\n  status code: 2xx, 4xx, 5xx etc\n}\n\n\n- GET\n- get feeds\n- /api/v1/feed/{userId}?pageSize=<>&&offset=\"\" \n\nResponse: \n[\n  pageSize: <> \n  offset: <> \n  episodes: [ { podCastEpisode1, ... }]\n]\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Api design:\n \n- POST \n- create podcast\n- /api/v1/podcast \n        x-token:  <>\n        https: general headers;\n\nRequest:   \n{\n    podcastName: <>\n    description: <> \n    .... \n    requestMeta: {} \n}\n\nResponse\n{\n  status code: 2xx, 4xx, 5xx etc\n}\n\n\n- GET\n- get feeds\n- /api/v1/feed/{userId}?pageSize=<>&&offset=\"\" \n\nResponse: \n[\n  pageSize: <> \n  offset: <> \n  episodes: [ { podCastEpisode1, ... }]\n]\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
