      "versionNonce": 1111849994,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769928208859,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "database ( cassandra ) \n\nquery pattern:\n - update , delete row\n - read feed \n\n no need very consistency requirement like transactions\n not complex join\n not very complex query\n\nhighly scalable priority -> nosql \nsomething like cassadra.  -> horizontally scalalbe\n\nwith cache for reading trending news feeds\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "database ( cassandra ) \n\nquery pattern:\n - update , delete row\n - read feed \n\n no need very consistency requirement like transactions\n not complex join\n not very complex query\n\nhighly scalable priority -> nosql \nsomething like cassadra.  -> horizontally scalalbe\n\nwith cache for reading trending news feeds\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
