    {
      "id": "hAs76SuoWi2R3iKEpRhwd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8043.5124761309,
      "y": 11987.085972014598,
      "width": 570.0595703125,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b36",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1178322390,
      "version": 570,
      "versionNonce": 171868362,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769928208859,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Estimations:  \n- MAU -10 million, 10% concurrent -> 1M / min\n    - qps for feed query -> 17k/s -> ~20k/s\n- total rss feed - 500k\n- total article per feed - 10/day /feed\n- retention 6 months\n- storage -> 5m article per day -> avg 1mb -> 5TB per day\n    -> 6months -> 9PB data. \n\n   min 200 datanodes -> 50TB\n\nso lets put in s3 feed \n1mb -> 1kb \n\n5gb per day -> \n9tb -> 6 months \n\n1 node -> 2 follower",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Estimations:  \n- MAU -10 million, 10% concurrent -> 1M / min\n    - qps for feed query -> 17k/s -> ~20k/s\n- total rss feed - 500k\n- total article per feed - 10/day /feed\n- retention 6 months\n- storage -> 5m article per day -> avg 1mb -> 5TB per day\n    -> 6months -> 9PB data. \n\n   min 200 datanodes -> 50TB\n\nso lets put in s3 feed \n1mb -> 1kb \n\n5gb per day -> \n9tb -> 6 months \n\n1 node -> 2 follower",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
