      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kafka as a service , System design: \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kafka as a service , System design: \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FzX_WMQSUXgnz-F4Spulc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9985.018805064621,
      "y": 9330.512137201336,
      "width": 1083.3394775390625,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b40",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1651344010,
      "version": 1178,
      "versionNonce": 1040489418,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769938494299,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FR: \n -  providing apis for dealing with kakfa\n -  user perspective: \n            - for all kafka apis\n                - create topic, create consumer group, publish, poll , partition creation, replication count etc. apis \n - control perspective.\n        - add cluster\n        - add broker, \n        - remove node from cluster, \n        - replace node etc. \n\n\n\nNFR: \n- highly scalable. \n- alerts, montoring and logging. \n- highly fault tolerant\n- highly available system. \n- isolation level\n- durable\n\n\nEstimations: \n- overall qps -> 1M/s ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FR: \n -  providing apis for dealing with kakfa\n -  user perspective: \n            - for all kafka apis\n                - create topic, create consumer group, publish, poll , partition creation, replication count etc. apis \n - control perspective.\n        - add cluster\n        - add broker, \n        - remove node from cluster, \n        - replace node etc. \n\n\n\nNFR: \n- highly scalable. \n- alerts, montoring and logging. \n- highly fault tolerant\n- highly available system. \n- isolation level\n- durable\n\n\nEstimations: \n- overall qps -> 1M/s ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
