      "text": "with the help of \ntenantId \n\nit will pull the cluster\nId and nodes Id \nof that cluster\n\nwith the help of this\nit with the kafka libaray\nwith those brokers \n-> NOTE: we do have tradeoff\neither use this or not, problem\nextra hop, failure radious incrase etc\n",
